    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Air Traffic Control</strong> is a dynamic aviation game where you guide airplanes and helicopters safely to their destinations. Tap and drag to create precise landing routes, ensuring smooth operations in busy skies.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3365130/extras/bbf41256dddc939992a122ce6135f8bb.poster.avif?t=1740555374\" width=576 height=324 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3365130/extras/bbf41256dddc939992a122ce6135f8bb.webm?t=1740555374\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3365130/extras/bbf41256dddc939992a122ce6135f8bb.mp4?t=1740555374\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Draw Your Flight Paths</strong><br>Get creative as you map out flight routes for incoming aircraft. Watch your planes follow your directions\u2014whether it's a masterpiece or pure chaos.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3365130/extras/efdb7b8bfa2866e54068dbac078d6c98.avif?t=1740555374\" data-has-big width=800 height=446 /></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Master Multitasking</strong><br>Skillfully manage multiple aircraft at once, avoiding mid-air collisions and keeping traffic flowing. Plan ahead to handle the pressure of managing a bustling airspace.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3365130/extras/b4383daa9ed8e3c025fe89c6f8ca01f0.avif?t=1740555374\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Explore Multiple Zones</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose from various themed airspace areas and airports, each with unique layouts and challenges.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3365130/extras/6e157257e8b034a6f96f3ff06488e1e8.avif?t=1740555374\" data-has-big width=800 height=448 /></span></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >How many planes and choppers can you guide to a perfect landing?</p>",
